      "title": "System Design Processes",
      "chapter": "4.0",
      "description": "Define and baseline stakeholder expectations, generate and baseline technical requirements, decompose them into logical/behavioural models and convert them into a design solution; applied top-down to each product layer until products can be built, bought or reused.",
